<p>The particular effects of those two amnestics were necessary for the containment, which is why I linked it.</p>
<p>The idea is that as it is infohazardous, a verified or complete description is not safe. However, you can intuit the anomalous effects from its recovery, also allowing you to see what the Foundation's thought process was as it was trying to determine what the anomaly was.</p>
<p><strong>Edit:</strong> I posted a laconic explanation of the anomaly in my author post.</p>

