					<span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/aismallard" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(4598089); return false;"  ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=4598089&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1606401735" alt="aismallard" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=4598089)"/></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/aismallard" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(4598089); return false;" >aismallard</a></span> <span class="odate time_1546725306 format_%25e%20%25b%20%25Y%2C%20%25H%3A%25M%7Cagohover">05 Jan 2019 21:55</span>
														</div>
			</div>
			<div class="content" id="post-content-4109702">
									

<p>Yeah for sure, I also appreciate when there are nice layman's explanations for the complex scips, since I don't usually pick up what it is the first time through.</p>
<p>I'm glad you picked that up, part of why the D-class have to be so filtered and brain-damaged is because even untrained humans can comprehend a lot of information passively, like you said: location, sound, smell, etc.</p>
<p>re: &quot;Somewhat spoilery&quot;</p>
<div class="collapsible-block">
<div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">+&nbsp;Spoilers</a></div>
<div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none">
<div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">-&nbsp;Spoilers</a></div>
<div class="collapsible-block-content">
<p>Haha that's a great headcanon. My original intention in including the toddler was to show it wasn't some kind of completely lethal hazard like a virus: for whatever reason that toddler never really realized what was happening, and so remained safe from its effects.</p>
<p>As for how it actually works, I'm fine leaving that unstated like the object itself, since it's actually not very important to the story. But perhaps it is related to <a href="/scp-4096">SCP-4096</a>, which is one of the inspirations for the work.<sup class="footnoteref"><a id="footnoteref-663292-1" href="javascript:;" class="footnoteref" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.utils.scrollToReference('footnote-663292-1')">1</a></sup> The core idea came from looking at the Cliché Con list, and trying to figure a good in-universe reason <em>why</em> a highly skilled Task Force would get totally wiped out.</p>
</div>
</div>
</div>
