<p>I definitely did take a gamble with the format of this article, and that means the rest of the article must meet a significantly higher standard for it to work. Your point about the recovery is an interesting one, and in retrospect I can see my own thought process around how to describe the anomaly being too concrete and inflexible. In the log, the details are admittedly very easy to gloss over, which could yield the effect you describe.</p>
<p>I'm not planning on rewriting the article, but I think some reflection on the narrative/logic characterization of expungement is something worthwhile for me to consider.</p>
<p>Thanks for the feedback.</p>

